+## POST /desktop/search
+
+Uses the exact `file`, `min_score`, `top_k`, and `face_index` multipart fields. It requires `X-CadetCatch-Gateway-Key` and is intended only for the Cloudflare Pages server function. It does not replace or modify `/search`.
+
+## POST /admin/photo-ingest
+
+Accepts JSON containing `source_url`, `source_filename`, `sha256`, and `collection`. Requires an HMAC-SHA256 signature of `<unix_timestamp>.<raw_json_body>` in `X-CadetCatch-Signature`, plus the timestamp in `X-CadetCatch-Timestamp`. Requests older than five minutes are rejected.
+
+## POST /admin/photo-ingest/reconcile
+
+Requires `X-API-Key`. Reads the configured source manifest and creates one durable record for each source URL. Re-running is idempotent.
+
+## GET /admin/ingestion/status
+
+Requires `X-API-Key`. Returns source count, indexed photos, indexed faces, skipped photos, failures, pending work, and last successful ingestion.
+
+## GET /search/status
+
+Public, read-only readiness summary used by the website. `ready` is true only when all expected source photos are accounted for, there are no failures, and no work remains queued or processing.
